# ── Standing ~/dev convention ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# One folder, one project. Code is built at THIS root, beside the research.
# The research haul is the competitive moat and never reaches GitHub.
# Stage named paths. Never `git add -A`. Verify with `git ls-files` before any push.

# Research haul: 15 Phase 0 dossiers, teardowns, adjudications, build specs,
# plus their extracted plain text. Competitive moat, never published.
/research/

# Private working material. recruitment-outreach-pack.md contains THIRD-PARTY
# CONTACT DETAIL for real people at Georgia Tech and KSU and must never be
# published. CREDITS-CLAIMED.md holds live sponsor credit codes. The rest carry
# strategy and judge analysis.
/private/

# The pre-rebuild corpus, kept locally only so the rebuild can be diffed
# against it. It is WRONG: 2,480 of 3,687 HMT rows, zero of the 256 Forbidden
# entries, and a 17-row segregation matrix that should have 18.
/data-legacy/

# Design reference captures of third-party sites. Studied, not redistributed.
/reference/captures/

# Assistant config stays local (strategy-laden; never committed)
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/

# ── The corpus is TRACKED ON PURPOSE ─────────────────────────────────────────
# /data/ holds the rebuilt 49 CFR corpus the public artifact depends on:
#   hmt.json  synonyms.json  segregation_table.json  compatibility_table.json
#   SHA256SUMS  PROVENANCE.md
# All public domain under 17 USC 105. Never add a blanket *.json rule, and
# never add /data/ here. The raw eCFR XML is the one exception below: it is
# 2.9 MB, re-fetchable from a pinned URL, and hashed in SHA256SUMS.
/data/raw/*.xml

# Env + secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
id_rsa
service-account*.json

